# Lock-Free SPSC Ring Buffer in Rust

## Conceptual Overview

A Single-Producer Single-Consumer (SPSC) ring buffer is a circular buffer where exactly one thread produces items and exactly one thread consumes them. It can be made lock-free using atomic indices and careful memory ordering. The key challenge is coordinating visibility of data between producer and consumer threads without data races.

